1.How do you troubleshoot process-related issues in Linux?------------------------process

	Check system load using top and uptime
	Identify high CPU/memory process using ps
	Verify process status and PID
	Check logs using tail and grep
	Verify ports and connectivity
	Use strace if process hangs
	Kill/restart process only after RCA
	Verify service after restart


2.How do you troubleshoot disk space issues in Linux?--------------------------------Disk

	Check disk usage using df -h
	Identify large directories using du -sh
	Find large files using find
	Check logs in /var/log
	Verify deleted files using lsof | grep deleted
	Check inode usage using df -i
	Clean temp/log files carefully
	Restart services if deleted files still occupy space
	Extend filesystem if required







